#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:321
#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:416
msgid "WhatsApp Conversations"
msgstr "Conversaciones de WhatsApp"

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:939
msgid "When a customer asks about a product, send its photos via WhatsApp."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un cliente pregunte por un producto, envíele fotos a través de "
"WhatsApp."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:843
#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:1191
msgid ""
"When a customer asks about shipping and provides a postal code, the plugin "
"bypasses the AI model and uses WooCommerce's own shipping functions to match "
"the correct zone and calculate the available methods and prices. The "
"response is sent directly to the customer, ensuring accurate rates and "
"preventing the model from picking the wrong zone or re-asking for the postal "
"code. Configured shipping zones are also passed to the AI model as fallback "
"context for any other shipping-related questions."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un cliente pregunta sobre el envío y proporciona un código postal, el "
"plugin omite el modelo de IA y utiliza las funciones de envío de WooCommerce "
"para seleccionar la zona correcta y calcular los métodos y precios "
"disponibles. La respuesta se envía directamente al cliente, lo que garantiza "
"tarifas precisas y evita que el modelo seleccione una zona incorrecta o "
"vuelva a solicitar el código postal. Las zonas de envío configuradas también "
"se pasan al modelo de IA como contexto de respaldo para cualquier otra "
"pregunta relacionada con el envío."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:1056
msgid ""
"When an order is confirmed via chat, append a WooCommerce cart link that "
"automatically adds the chosen products so the customer can pay. Requires "
"WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se confirme un pedido por chat, añade un enlace al carrito de "
"WooCommerce que agregue automáticamente los productos seleccionados para que "
"el cliente pueda pagar. Requiere WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-post-type-invoice.php:174
msgid ""
"When enabled, a new invoice will be automatically generated every year with "
"the same items and amounts. An email notification will be sent to the "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esta función esté activada, se generará automáticamente una nueva "
"factura cada año con los mismos artículos e importes. Se enviará una "
"notificación por correo electrónico al administrador."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1188
msgid ""
"When enabled, all Instagram AI activity is logged to <code>wp-"
"content/uploads/pn-customers-manager-logs/instagram-ai.log</code>. Useful "
"for debugging webhook and AI issues. <strong>Disable in production</strong> "
"to avoid unnecessary disk usage."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitada, toda la actividad de IA de Instagram se registra en "
"<code>wp-content/uploads/pn-customers-manager-logs/instagram-ai.log</code>. "
"Útil para depurar problemas de webhook e IA. <strong>Desactívela en "
"producción</strong> para evitar un uso innecesario del disco."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1102
msgid ""
"When enabled, all WhatsApp AI activity is logged to <code>wp-"
"content/uploads/pn-customers-manager-logs/whatsapp-ai.log</code>. Useful for "
"debugging webhook and AI issues. <strong>Disable in production</strong> to "
"avoid unnecessary disk usage."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitada, toda la actividad de IA de WhatsApp se registra en "
"<code>wp-content/uploads/pn-customers-manager-logs/whatsapp-ai.log</code>. "
"Útil para depurar problemas de webhook e IA. <strong>Desactívela en "
"producción</strong> para evitar un uso innecesario del disco."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1305
msgid ""
"When enabled, every contact form submission will be checked against the "
"Akismet API. Suspected bots will still be stored but automatically flagged "
"as spam and excluded from notification emails."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitada, cada envío de formulario de contacto se verificará "
"con la API de Akismet. Los bots sospechosos se seguirán almacenando, pero se "
"marcarán automáticamente como spam y se excluirán de los correos "
"electrónicos de notificación."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:1066
#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-funnel-builder.php:1340
msgid ""
"When the AI detects a request that cannot be fulfilled with a simple "
"purchase link (B2B, bulk, custom products, special shipping), it will "
"collect the details and forward them by email to the selected recipients."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la IA detecta una solicitud que no se puede satisfacer con un simple "
